# Copy this file to .private-words (which is gitignored) and list, one per line,
# the words that identify your family: first names, nicknames, a school, a street.
# The pre-commit hook blocks any commit whose added lines contain one of them,
# case-insensitively.
#
# The real file is gitignored on purpose: a committed denylist would itself
# publish exactly what it exists to protect. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example entries (replace with real ones in your local copy):
# Sofia
# rue de l'Exemple
